# LLMDD Advisor approval tokens.
#
# Only the standing workspace grant is tracked. Scenario-specific grants
# are local-only: they are narrow, they expire, and committing one bakes a
# permission slip into permanent history that cannot be revoked by git.
#
# llmdd-workspace is the standing grant for operating .LLMDD design
# artifacts and .LLMDD tools. It is the one exception.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!llmdd-workspace.json
